---
import Avatar from './Avatar.astro';
import SectionHead from './SectionHead.astro';
---

<section id="routines" class="relative z-10 mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl scroll-mt-8 px-4 sm:px-6">
  <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
    <div class="lg:order-2">
      <SectionHead eyebrow="Routines" tone="accent-2" title="Put the crew on a schedule.">
        Ask in plain words. The crew does the work ahead of time, and you see exactly what will go
        out, where and when. Approve it, and clanks sends exactly that at exactly then. Unapproved,
        it never goes out, and if your laptop was asleep, it isn't posted late.
      </SectionHead>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-3xl border border-line bg-panel/60 p-5 sm:p-6 lg:order-1">
      <p class="flex gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-raised px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-white/85">
        <Avatar clank="atlas" size="xs" class="mt-0.5" />
        “Every Friday, have Prism make a promo banner for the weekend special and post it on X at
        5pm.”
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-amber-300/25 bg-amber-300/[0.04] p-4">
        <p class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs text-amber-100">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="animate-pulse-dot size-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300"></span>
            Goes out Fri 5:00 pm · @bluecart on X
          </span>
          <span class="text-dim">Needs you</span>
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex gap-3 rounded-xl border border-line bg-black/40 p-3">
          <span class="grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-sky-400 text-sm font-semibold text-black">
            B
          </span>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="text-[13px]">
              <b class="font-medium">Blue Cart Coffee</b> <span class="text-dim">@bluecart</span>
            </p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/85">
              Weekend special: iced oat lattes, two for $9. Find us at the market, Saturday and
              Sunday from 7.
            </p>
            <div class="mt-2 grid h-28 place-items-center rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-fuchsia-300/70 via-violet-400/60 to-sky-400/60 px-3 text-center text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-black/80">
              2 for $9 · this weekend
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-white px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-black">
            Approve for 5:00 pm
          </span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-line px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs text-white/80">
            Send back
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
